{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"776","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. A Serial Killer"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Our beloved detective, Sherlock is currently trying to catch a serial killer who kills a person each day. Using his powers of deduction, he came to know that the killer has a strategy for selecting his next victim."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The killer starts with two potential victims on his first day, selects one of these two, kills selected victim and replaces him with a new person. He repeats this procedure each day. This way, each day he has two potential victims to choose from. Sherlock knows the initial two potential victims. Also, he knows the murder that happened on a particular day and the new person who replaced this victim."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You need to help him get all the pairs of potential victims at each day so that Sherlock can observe some pattern."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"First line of input contains two names (length of each of them doesn't exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":"), the two initials potential victims. Next line contains integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":"), the number of days."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains two names (length of each of them doesn't exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":"), first being the person murdered on this day and the second being the one who replaced that person."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input format is consistent, that is, a person murdered is guaranteed to be from the two potential victims at that time. Also, all the names are guaranteed to be distinct and consists of lowercase English letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line should contain the two persons from which the killer selects for the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th murder. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(n + 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line should contain the two persons from which the next victim is selected. In each line, the two names can be printed in any order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"ross rachel\n4\nross joey\nrachel phoebe\nphoebe monica\nmonica chandler\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"ross rachel\njoey rachel\njoey phoebe\njoey monica\njoey chandler\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"icm codeforces\n1\ncodeforces technex\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"icm codeforces\nicm technex\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In first example, the killer starts with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ross"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"rachel"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" After day "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ross"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is killed and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"joey"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" appears. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" After day "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"rachel"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is killed and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"phoebe"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" appears. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" After day "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"phoebe"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is killed and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"monica"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" appears. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" After day "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"monica"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is killed and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chandler"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" appears. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"776A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/776/problem/A"}